  "description": "Server / IED runtime: association handling, data model hosting, report generation and buffering, control handling, and the hooks the Simulator app uses to drive scenarios. Security-relevant from the start: role/authorization policy for writes/controls/files, connection/request-rate/PDU-size/nesting limits, resource-exhaustion resistance, audit records for control operations. Owns crash/restart recovery policy: which state survives a process restart (buffered reports/EntryIDs, dynamic datasets if supported, file-transfer partial state, configuration/certificate state) versus which does not (control state is normally not resumed blindly) -- see docs/roadmap.md Phase 7.",
  "id": "Iec61850.Server",
  "isPrerelease": true,
  "lastEdited": "2026-08-28T08:55:27.023Z",
  "licenseExpression": "Apache-2.0",
